<view class="page landing">
  <view class="topline">
    <text class="eyebrow">PERSONAL VALUE LAB</text>
    <text class="settings" bindtap="openSettings">数据与隐私</text>
  </view>
  <view class="map-orbit">
    <view class="orbit orbit-one"></view><view class="orbit orbit-two"></view><view class="orbit orbit-three"></view>
    <view class="map-dot dot-one"></view><view class="map-dot dot-two"></view><view class="map-dot dot-three"></view>
  </view>
  <view class="eyebrow">3 分钟 · 无需登录 · 本地计算</view>
  <view class="title">你的收入系统<br/>能走多远？</view>
  <view class="body intro">用企业 DCF 估值框架，看清显性工作期、退休后现金流与终值构成；看清何时停止，以及一个目标需要什么现实条件。</view>
  <view class="pill-row">
    <text>不上传敏感资产</text>
    <text>不给人定价</text>
    <text>恪守 DCF 纪律</text>
  </view>
  <button class="primary-button start" bindtap="start">进入现金流实验室</button>
  <button wx:if="{{hasDraft}}" class="secondary-button continue" bindtap="continueDraft">继续上次的测算</button>
  <view class="rule-link" bindtap="openRules">它是怎么算的？</view>
  <view class="notice footer">基于现金流折现（DCF）教育模型，不衡量人的价值，不用于征信、信贷或招聘。</view>
</view>
